## Upstream material

This project derives material from the following upstream works. The SPDX-JSON
SBOM attached to each GitHub release names the complete dependency inventory of
the released binary.

| Upstream work | Licence | What is derived | Distribution |
|---|---|---|---|
| HashiCorp `terraform-provider-scaffolding-framework` | MPL-2.0 | Entry point (`main.go`) and the provider build/serve pattern | Source and binary |
| OpenMetadata Go client (`open-metadata/openmetadata-sdk`) | Apache-2.0 | REST API client compiled into the provider | Binary |
| HashiCorp Terraform plugin libraries | MPL-2.0 | `terraform-plugin-framework`, `terraform-plugin-framework-validators`, `terraform-plugin-go`, `terraform-plugin-log` and `terraform-plugin-testing` are compiled into the provider and its tests; `terraform-plugin-docs` is used at build time to generate `docs/` | Binary and build tooling |
| `google/uuid` | BSD-3-Clause | UUID handling in tests | Test code |

The published identifiers are the Go module path
`github.com/caberdo/terraform-provider-openmetadata` and the Terraform Registry
namespace `registry.terraform.io/caberdo/openmetadata`; the source repository is
<https://github.com/caberdo/terraform-provider-openmetadata>.

OpenMetadata itself is not included in this distribution; the provider talks to
an OpenMetadata server over its REST API.

